{"concept":"present","groups":[{"id":"source-use","name":{"ru":"Употребления в речи, образе и действии","en":"Uses in speech, image and action"},"count":14}],"occurrences":[{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.07","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c899e3dec45bb493a6d5be4bcd3abab4","tos.text-unit.sid-c899e3dec45bb493a6d5be4bcd3abab4"]},"form":"Augenblick","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"judges","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","gateway","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Высшее мгновение преступника — суд над собой.","en":"The criminal’s highest moment is judgment of himself."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b2d602b9b13ec901706134d760c2d03b","tos.text-unit.sid-b2d602b9b13ec901706134d760c2d03b"]},"form":"Augenblicke","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["gateway","body-self","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Покорность мгновению связана с бедностью способности ждать.","en":"Surrender to the moment is linked to an impoverished ability to wait."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-933bbeaeee0cbb8c339a199aa6804729","tos.text-unit.sid-933bbeaeee0cbb8c339a199aa6804729"]},"form":"Augenblicke","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"source-use","neighbours":["memory","gateway","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель оплакивает божественные мгновения юности.","en":"The teacher mourns youth’s divine moments."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-8f774668bfbd5c9ef912ba4bb349f391","tos.text-unit.sid-8f774668bfbd5c9ef912ba4bb349f391"]},"form":"Augenblicke","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"source-use","neighbours":["affirmation","identity","difference","gateway","eternity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Погибшие мгновения сохраняются как нежные вечности.","en":"Lost moments are retained as tender eternities."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-529324bbc43a9211aaa9141a45405c60","tos.text-unit.sid-529324bbc43a9211aaa9141a45405c60"]},"form":"Augenblick","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"source-use","neighbours":["gateway","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Враждебное действие сокращает вечное до вспышки мгновения.","en":"Hostile action shortens the eternal to a moment’s flash."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-36a3c9915901a496c64276fe2da78079","tos.text-unit.sid-36a3c9915901a496c64276fe2da78079"]},"form":"Augenblick","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"sailors","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["gateway","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Столкновение дорог получает имя «Мгновенье».","en":"The paths’ collision receives the name “Moment.”"}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b8cef20c095784beb2dd363f1a0e98cb","tos.text-unit.sid-b8cef20c095784beb2dd363f1a0e98cb"]},"form":"Augenblick","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"sailors","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["counterfactual","gateway","two-paths","eternity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"От этого мгновения дорога уходит назад в вечность.","en":"From this moment the path stretches backwards into eternity."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e060da93a6971669a066b72b51ff92bf","tos.text-unit.sid-e060da93a6971669a066b72b51ff92bf"]},"form":"Augenblick","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"sailors","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["gateway","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Возвращение самого мгновения становится вопросом.","en":"The moment’s own return becomes a question."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3254efddd6ccc24efe6bbe5313e7f98d","tos.text-unit.sid-3254efddd6ccc24efe6bbe5313e7f98d"]},"form":"Augenblick","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"sailors","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","gateway","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Сцепление этого мига с будущим ставится вопросом.","en":"This moment’s linkage with the future is posed as a question."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-fb23cb044b07bb7f12da7e5f29161308","tos.text-unit.sid-fb23cb044b07bb7f12da7e5f29161308"]},"form":"Augenblicke","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["fate","identity","necessity","gateway","innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Время открывается опытом свободы самой необходимости.","en":"Time opens through an experience of necessity itself as freedom."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-1cb5553f5085278e3affc4629d079c80","tos.text-unit.sid-1cb5553f5085278e3affc4629d079c80"]},"form":"Augenblick","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"magician","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["gateway","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Краткая подлинность чародея получает признание учителя.","en":"The magician’s brief authenticity receives the teacher’s recognition."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.06","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-8a8698a093651c087a2efd29ebb8d5c0","tos.text-unit.sid-8a8698a093651c087a2efd29ebb8d5c0"]},"form":"Augenblicke","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"source-use","neighbours":["courage","identity","difference","gateway"],"line":{"ru":"Случайный взгляд папы превращает уклонение учителя во встречу.","en":"The pope’s chance glance turns the teacher’s evasion into an encounter."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3565ea44c6c74043f6879152401ac8af","tos.text-unit.sid-3565ea44c6c74043f6879152401ac8af"]},"form":"Augen-Blick","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra-soul","mode":"dream","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["gateway","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Лучшее счастье сгущается в малейшем движении и мгновении.","en":"The best happiness concentrates in the smallest movement and moment."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ea9d997ac39761114127a6c0b1800565","tos.text-unit.sid-9a3da971437436d2ef97a5e5de89a4b2"]},"form":"Augenblick","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","affirmation","gateway","joy-lust","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Желание одного счастливого мига вновь зовёт всё.","en":"Desire for one happy moment again calls everything back."}}]}
